      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Currently, the precheck makes no assumptions about the pads, except for checking that the pad masks exists at the right places.\n\nI suppose the platform could provide a test plan for the default padring and the foundry pads, and allow to upload a custom test plan.\n\nHowever, what format such a test plan should have, and which tests are available (e.g. shorts to other pads, measuring ESD diodes, etc.), would be for @Lauri to say.",
